@startuml
actor "会员" as Member
participant "顾客端" as App
participant "预约服务" as Reservation
participant "菜单/订单服务" as Order
participant "优惠服务" as Coupon
participant "支付网关" as Pay
participant "通知服务" as Notify
Member -> App: 选择预约并提交菜品
App -> Reservation: 校验预约状态
Reservation --> App: 已确认/可点单
App -> Order: 创建订单
Order -> Coupon: 校验优惠券
Coupon --> Order: 返回优惠金额
Order -> Pay: 发起支付
Pay --> Order: 支付成功
Order -> Reservation: 绑定订单
Order -> Notify: 发送下单成功通知
Notify --> Member: 小程序/短信提醒
@enduml
